      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "If arriving earlier matters most, I’d investigate the Hong Kong Aeroplan award first: it reaches Bangkok on the evening of January 16, while the later-departing Hong Kong option arrives the next morning. The tradeoff is leaving SFO earlier; the two have nearly the same elapsed time.",
